  "description": "The daughter of a famous actress, Sungha is glamorous, confident, and beautiful. However, her relationships never last longer than one month, and most of the attention she gets is from…women? \n\nIn order to get in a serious relationship with Mr. Right, she decides that she needs to prevent all women from falling in love with her. So when Sungha first sees the new transfer student, Rahee, she wants to make some things clear. \n\n“You’re not already in love with me, are you?\"\n“Don’t worry. You’re the kind of person I can’t stand.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
